            <ArticleTitle>CHROMagar mSuperCARBA and RAPIDEC® Carba NP test for detection of carbapenemase-producing Enterobacteriaceae.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">S0732-8893(17)30320-6</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.diagmicrobio.2017.10.009</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A novel chromogenic medium CHROMagar mSuperCARBA was evaluated to detect carbapenem-resistant Gram-negatives. This medium is as sensitive and as specific as the SUPERCARBA medium for detecting KPC, MBL and OXA-48-type producers (100% and 100%, respectively) and is compatible with subsequent testing of carbapenemase activity using the RAPIDEC® CARBA NP.</AbstractText>
